<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="满天星辰不及你"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ycccc"/><amll:meta key="album" value="满天星辰不及你"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="HKD012376178"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001NTymr2HdIZz"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="335005029"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="6VeeliR29T2qSNW3m7oXHM"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1793187740"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:17.550"><div begin="19.070" end="3:17.550"><p begin="19.070" end="23.830" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.070" end="19.210">晚</span><span begin="19.310" end="19.770">风</span><span begin="19.770" end="19.880">里</span><span begin="19.990" end="20.590">藏</span><span begin="20.590" end="20.990">着</span><span begin="21.750" end="22.210">多</span><span begin="22.560" end="22.840">少</span><span begin="22.940" end="23.320">精</span><span begin="23.320" end="23.830">灵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">晚風裡藏著多少精靈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">How many elves are hiding in the evening wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">夜風にはどれだけの妖精が隠れているのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">밤바람 속엔 얼마나 많은 요정이 숨어 있을까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Combien d&apos;esprits se cachent dans la brise du soir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuántas hadas se esconden en la brisa nocturna</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie viele Feen verbergen sich wohl in der Abendbrise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quantas fadas se escondem na brisa da noite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сколько же эльфов прячется в вечернем ветре</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quanti spiriti si nascondono nella brezza della sera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wan feng li cang zhe duo shao jing ling</span></p><p begin="25.740" end="30.880" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.740" end="25.920">满</span><span begin="26.010" end="26.480">天</span><span begin="26.480" end="26.580">的</span><span begin="26.730" end="27.140">星</span><span begin="27.230" end="27.850">辰</span><span begin="28.440" end="28.980">都</span><span begin="29.330" end="29.500">被</span><span begin="29.650" end="30.020">唤</span><span begin="30.170" end="30.880">醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">滿天的星辰都被喚醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The stars filling the sky have all been awakened</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">満天の星々が目を覚ましていく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">밤하늘 가득한 별들이 모두 깨어났어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toutes les étoiles du ciel s&apos;en trouvent éveillées</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todas las estrellas del cielo han sido despertadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der ganze Himmel voller Sterne wird zum Leben erweckt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Todas as estrelas do firmamento foram despertadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пробудились все звезды на ночном небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutte le stelle nel cielo si sono risvegliate</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">man tian de xing chen dou bei huan xing</span></p><p begin="32.660" end="37.490" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.660" end="32.900">白</span><span begin="32.900" end="33.120">天</span><span begin="33.120" end="33.330">那</span><span begin="33.480" end="33.970">些</span><span begin="33.970" end="34.130">流</span><span begin="34.260" end="34.750">放</span><span begin="34.750" end="34.970">的</span><span begin="35.130" end="36.890">光</span><span begin="36.890" end="37.490">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">白天那些流放的光明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Those exiled lights of the daytime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">昼間に放たれたあの光たちが</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">낮 동안 흩어져 있던 빛들이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces lumières exilées durant la journée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esa luz que fue exiliada durante el día</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ins Exil geschickte Licht des Tages</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquela luz que foi exilada durante o dia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тот свет что был изгнан днем</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quelle luci esiliate durante il giorno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bai tian na xie liu fang de guang ming</span></p><p begin="38.010" end="42.630" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.010" end="38.240">剪</span><span begin="38.240" end="38.370">接</span><span begin="38.470" end="38.900">成</span><span begin="38.900" end="39.030">夜</span><span begin="39.300" end="39.680">空</span><span begin="40.190" end="40.650">仰</span><span begin="40.650" end="40.960">望</span><span begin="40.960" end="41.140">的</span><span begin="41.280" end="41.690">风</span><span begin="41.800" end="42.630">景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">剪接成夜空仰望的風景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Spliced into the scenery we look up to in the night sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">見上げる夜空の風景へと紡がれる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하나로 엮여 우러러보는 밤하늘의 풍경이 되었네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Forgent le paysage nocturne que nous contemplons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Se edita en el paisaje que admiramos en el cielo nocturno</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird zu jener nächtlichen Kulisse verwoben zu der wir aufblicken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É recortada na paisagem que admiramos no céu noturno</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сплетается в пейзаж неба которым я любуюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Montate nel paesaggio che ammiro guardando il cielo notturno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jian jie cheng ye kong yang wang de feng jing</span></p><p begin="45.360" end="48.160" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.360" end="45.550">看</span><span begin="45.550" end="45.760">天</span><span begin="45.760" end="45.860">台</span><span begin="45.950" end="46.440">上</span><span begin="46.440" end="46.500">路</span><span begin="46.610" end="46.930">过</span><span begin="47.030" end="47.120">几</span><span begin="47.240" end="47.450">颗</span><span begin="47.450" end="47.550">流</span><span begin="47.640" end="48.160">星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">看天台上路過幾顆流星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Watching a few shooting stars pass by over the rooftop</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">屋上を通り過ぎる幾つかの流れ星を見て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">옥상 위를 스쳐 지나가는 별똥별들을 봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Regarde ces étoiles filantes passer au-dessus du toit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Viendo pasar unas estrellas fugaces desde la azotea</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sieh wie ein paar Sternschnuppen über die Dachterrasse ziehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Olho para as estrelas cadentes passando pelo terraço</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Смотрю с крыши на пролетающие падающие звезды</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guarda qualche stella cadente passare sopra la terrazza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan tian tai shang lu guo ji ke liu xing</span></p><p begin="48.670" end="51.460" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.670" end="48.860">说</span><span begin="48.860" end="49.100">出</span><span begin="49.100" end="49.320">口</span><span begin="49.320" end="49.530">的</span><span begin="49.660" end="49.990">誓</span><span begin="49.990" end="50.260">言</span><span begin="50.360" end="50.550">会</span><span begin="50.550" end="50.690">有</span><span begin="50.790" end="51.000">回</span><span begin="51.000" end="51.460">音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">說出口的誓言會有回音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The vows spoken out loud will have an echo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">口にした誓いは必ず響き合う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">입 밖으로 꺼낸 맹세는 메아리가 되어 돌아올 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les vœux prononcés trouveront toujours un écho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las promesas pronunciadas tendrán su eco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ausgesprochene Schwüre werden ein Echo finden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As promessas ditas em voz alta terão um eco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Произнесенные клятвы обязательно отзовутся эхом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le promesse pronunciate avranno un&apos;eco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shuo chu kou de shi yan hui you hui yin</span></p><p begin="52.040" end="54.710" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.040" end="52.200">那</span><span begin="52.200" end="52.460">就</span><span begin="52.460" end="52.680">让</span><span begin="52.680" end="52.910">我</span><span begin="52.910" end="53.130">们</span><span begin="53.500" end="53.700">勇</span><span begin="53.700" end="53.940">敢</span><span begin="53.940" end="54.170">地</span><span begin="54.170" end="54.560">约</span><span begin="54.560" end="54.710">定</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就讓我們勇敢地約定</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then let us bravely make a promise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だから勇敢に約束を交わそう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그럼 우리 용기 내어 약속하자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors faisons courageusement notre promesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entonces hagamos valientemente una promesa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Also lass uns mutig unser Versprechen geben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então vamos fazer a nossa promessa corajosamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так давай же смело дадим друг другу обещание</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Allora promettiamocelo coraggiosamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na jiu rang wo men yong gan de yue ding</span></p><p begin="54.750" end="57.710" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.750" end="54.950">对</span><span begin="54.950" end="55.130">星</span><span begin="55.130" end="55.390">空</span><span begin="55.390" end="55.560">指</span><span begin="55.560" end="55.800">尖</span><span begin="55.800" end="55.970">画</span><span begin="55.970" end="56.420">出</span><span begin="56.420" end="56.500">了</span><span begin="56.650" end="56.920">心</span><span begin="57.070" end="57.710">形</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">對星空指尖畫出了心形</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Drawing a heart shape at the starry sky with our fingertips</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星空に向かって指先でハートを描く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별 쏟아지는 하늘에 손끝으로 하트를 그리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dessinant un cœur du bout des doigts vers le ciel étoilé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dibujando un corazón con la punta de los dedos hacia el firmamento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und mit den Fingerspitzen ein Herz in den Sternenhimmel zeichnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desenhando um coração com a ponta dos dedos para o céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Рисуя пальцами сердце на фоне звездного неба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Disegnando un cuore con le dita verso il cielo stellato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dui xing kong zhi jian hua chu le xin xing</span></p><p begin="58.000" end="1:01.270" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.000" end="58.250">星</span><span begin="58.250" end="58.370">际</span><span begin="58.470" end="58.690">闪</span><span begin="58.690" end="58.910">耀</span><span begin="58.910" end="59.350">光</span><span begin="59.350" end="59.770">影</span><span begin="59.770" end="59.970">落</span><span begin="59.970" end="1:00.170">入</span><span begin="1:00.170" end="1:00.370">你</span><span begin="1:00.370" end="1:00.560">的</span><span begin="1:00.560" end="1:00.980">眼</span><span begin="1:00.980" end="1:01.270">睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星際閃耀光影落入你的眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Interstellar shining light and shadows fall into your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星々の瞬く光と影が君の瞳に舞い落ちる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별무리의 반짝이는 빛이 네 눈동자에 내려앉아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;éclat scintillant des astres tombe dans tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La luz y sombra estelar brillan y caen en tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sternenlicht und Schatten fallen strahlend in deine Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O brilho cintilante do espaço cai nos seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мерцающий свет звезд падает в твои глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Luci e ombre brillanti delle stelle cadono nei tuoi occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xing ji shan yao guang ying luo ru ni de yan jing</span></p><p begin="1:01.630" end="1:04.710" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.630" end="1:01.850">如</span><span begin="1:01.850" end="1:02.050">迷</span><span begin="1:02.050" end="1:02.150">人</span><span begin="1:02.260" end="1:02.330">的</span><span begin="1:02.420" end="1:02.650">水</span><span begin="1:02.650" end="1:03.110">晶</span><span begin="1:03.110" end="1:03.190">把</span><span begin="1:03.340" end="1:03.700">浪</span><span begin="1:03.700" end="1:03.790">漫</span><span begin="1:03.900" end="1:04.310">放</span><span begin="1:04.310" end="1:04.710">映</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如迷人的水晶把浪漫放映</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like charming crystals projecting romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">魅惑的な水晶のようにロマンチックを映し出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">매혹적인 수정처럼 로맨스를 비춰주네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme un cristal envoûtant projetant la romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un cristal encantador proyectando el romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und projizieren Romantik wie ein bezaubernder Kristall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Projetando o romance como um cristal encantador</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно чарующий кристалл транслирующий романтику</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come un cristallo incantevole che proietta il romanticismo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ru mi ren de shui jing ba lang man fang ying</span></p><p begin="1:05.110" end="1:08.080" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.110" end="1:05.340">爱</span><span begin="1:05.340" end="1:05.560">是</span><span begin="1:05.560" end="1:05.790">种</span><span begin="1:05.790" end="1:05.870">魔</span><span begin="1:05.970" end="1:06.320">法</span><span begin="1:06.420" end="1:06.860">给</span><span begin="1:06.860" end="1:07.250">我</span><span begin="1:07.250" end="1:07.480">们</span><span begin="1:07.480" end="1:07.790">指</span><span begin="1:07.900" end="1:08.080">引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">愛是種魔法給我們指引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Love is a kind of magic guiding us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">愛は魔法のように私たちを導いてくれる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑은 우리를 이끌어주는 마법이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;amour est une magie qui nous guide</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El amor es una magia que nos guía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liebe ist eine Magie die uns leitet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O amor é uma magia que nos serve de guia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любовь это магия что указывает нам путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;amore è una magia che ci fa da guida</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ai shi zhong mo fa gei wo men zhi yin</span></p><p begin="1:08.470" end="1:11.350" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.470" end="1:08.720">穿</span><span begin="1:08.720" end="1:08.890">过</span><span begin="1:08.890" end="1:09.100">黑</span><span begin="1:09.100" end="1:09.280">暗</span><span begin="1:09.280" end="1:09.550">森</span><span begin="1:09.550" end="1:09.720">林</span><span begin="1:09.960" end="1:10.360">去</span><span begin="1:10.360" end="1:10.560">寻</span><span begin="1:10.560" end="1:10.770">找</span><span begin="1:10.770" end="1:10.860">黎</span><span begin="1:10.990" end="1:11.350">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過黑暗森林去尋找黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Through the dark forest to seek the dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">暗い森を抜けて夜明けを探しに行こう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어두운 숲을 지나 여명을 찾아가게 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la sombre forêt à la recherche de l&apos;aube</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Atravesando el bosque oscuro para buscar el amanecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch den dunklen Wald um die Morgendämmerung zu finden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Atravessando a floresta escura em busca do amanhecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь темный лес на поиски рассвета</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraversando la foresta oscura per cercare l&apos;alba</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chuan guo hei an sen lin qu xun zhao li ming</span></p><p begin="1:11.370" end="1:14.560" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.370" end="1:11.610">星</span><span begin="1:11.610" end="1:11.770">际</span><span begin="1:11.770" end="1:12.030">洒</span><span begin="1:12.030" end="1:12.150">下</span><span begin="1:12.250" end="1:12.670">光</span><span begin="1:12.670" end="1:13.080">影</span><span begin="1:13.080" end="1:13.320">点</span><span begin="1:13.320" end="1:13.510">亮</span><span begin="1:13.510" end="1:13.700">你</span><span begin="1:13.700" end="1:13.890">的</span><span begin="1:13.890" end="1:14.280">眼</span><span begin="1:14.280" end="1:14.560">睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星際灑下光影點亮你的眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Interstellar sprinkled light and shadows light up your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星々の光と影が降り注ぎ君の瞳を照らし出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별무리가 흩뿌린 빛이 네 눈동자를 밝히고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lueur des astres se répand et illumine tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El espacio esparce luz y sombra iluminando tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sternenlicht und Schatten regnen herab und erhellen deine Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O universo derrama luz iluminando os seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Звездный свет проливается зажигая твои глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le stelle spargono luci e ombre illuminando i tuoi occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xing ji sa xia guang ying dian liang ni de yan jing</span></p><p begin="1:14.910" end="1:18.000" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.910" end="1:15.160">像</span><span begin="1:15.160" end="1:15.350">缤</span><span begin="1:15.350" end="1:15.580">纷</span><span begin="1:15.580" end="1:15.790">的</span><span begin="1:15.790" end="1:15.980">梦</span><span begin="1:15.980" end="1:16.430">境</span><span begin="1:16.430" end="1:16.560">我</span><span begin="1:16.660" end="1:17.040">不</span><span begin="1:17.040" end="1:17.140">愿</span><span begin="1:17.240" end="1:17.540">苏</span><span begin="1:17.660" end="1:18.000">醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">像繽紛的夢境我不願甦醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a colorful dreamland from which I don&apos;t want to wake up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">色彩豊かな夢のようで私は目覚めたくない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다채로운 꿈결 같아 난 깨어나고 싶지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme un rêve coloré dont je refuse d&apos;être éveillée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un sueño colorido del que no quiero despertar maravillada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie ein farbenfroher Traum aus dem ich nicht erwachen will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como em um sonho colorido do qual eu, apaixonada, não quero acordar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно в красочном сне от которого я не хотела бы просыпаться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come in un sogno colorato da cui non voglio essere svegliata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xiang bin fen de meng jing wo bu yuan su xing</span></p><p begin="1:18.520" end="1:21.400" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.520" end="1:18.690">余</span><span begin="1:18.690" end="1:18.930">生</span><span begin="1:18.930" end="1:19.120">的</span><span begin="1:19.120" end="1:19.330">光</span><span begin="1:19.330" end="1:19.610">阴</span><span begin="1:19.730" end="1:20.170">牵</span><span begin="1:20.170" end="1:20.540">你</span><span begin="1:20.540" end="1:20.790">手</span><span begin="1:20.790" end="1:21.070">前</span><span begin="1:21.200" end="1:21.400">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">餘生的光陰牽你手前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Holding your hand to move forward for the rest of my life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">残りの人生の時間は君と手を繋いで歩んでいく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남은 생의 시간 동안 네 손을 잡고 나아갈게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je marcherai en te tenant la main pour le reste de ma vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El tiempo del resto de mi vida avanzaré aferrada a tu mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Rest meines Lebens werde ich deine Hand haltend voranschreiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No tempo que me resta caminharei segurando a sua mão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Остаток жизни я пройду держа тебя за руку</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per il resto del tempo camminerò tenendoti per mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu sheng de guang yin qian ni shou qian xing</span></p><p begin="1:21.640" end="1:26.410" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.640" end="1:21.760">我</span><span begin="1:21.850" end="1:22.230">们</span><span begin="1:22.230" end="1:22.370">共</span><span begin="1:22.460" end="1:22.680">赴</span><span begin="1:22.680" end="1:22.760">一</span><span begin="1:22.880" end="1:23.160">场</span><span begin="1:23.480" end="1:23.930">光</span><span begin="1:23.930" end="1:24.080">年</span><span begin="1:24.190" end="1:24.770">的</span><span begin="1:24.770" end="1:25.380">旅</span><span begin="1:25.590" end="1:26.410">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們共赴一場光年的旅行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s go on a light-year journey together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちは共に光年の旅へと出かけるんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리 함께 광년의 여행을 떠나자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Partons ensemble pour un voyage d&apos;une année-lumière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Juntos emprendemos un viaje de años luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir begeben uns gemeinsam auf eine lichtjahrelange Reise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos embarcar juntos em uma viagem de anos-luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы вместе отправимся в путешествие длиною в световой год</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Siamo pronte a partire per un viaggio lungo anni luce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo men gong fu yi chang guang nian de lv xing</span></p><p begin="1:39.060" end="1:43.810" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.060" end="1:39.160">你</span><span begin="1:39.290" end="1:39.650">就</span><span begin="1:39.750" end="1:40.060">像</span><span begin="1:40.060" end="1:40.430">夜</span><span begin="1:40.660" end="1:41.040">色</span><span begin="1:41.800" end="1:42.620">温</span><span begin="1:42.620" end="1:42.790">柔</span><span begin="1:42.940" end="1:43.330">降</span><span begin="1:43.330" end="1:43.810">临</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你就像夜色溫柔降臨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You gently descend just like the night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君はまるで優しく降り注ぐ夜のよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 밤의 어둠처럼 다정하게 내려앉아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu descends avec la même douceur que la nuit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desciendes suavemente como la misma noche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du brichst herein so sanft wie die Nacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você chega tão gentilmente quanto a própria noite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты нежно спускаешься словно ночная мгла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sei come la notte che scende dolcemente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ni jiu xiang ye se wen rou jiang lin</span></p><p begin="1:45.740" end="1:50.940" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.740" end="1:45.820">这</span><span begin="1:45.930" end="1:46.380">城</span><span begin="1:46.380" end="1:46.550">市</span><span begin="1:46.710" end="1:47.080">和</span><span begin="1:47.310" end="1:47.670">你</span><span begin="1:48.490" end="1:49.090">都</span><span begin="1:49.310" end="1:49.560">很</span><span begin="1:49.560" end="1:49.940">安</span><span begin="1:50.150" end="1:50.940">静</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這城市和你都很安靜</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Both this city and you are so quiet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この街も君もとても静かだね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 도시도 너도 아주 고요해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette ville et toi êtes si paisibles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta ciudad y tú están muy silenciosos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Diese Stadt und du ihr seid beide so still</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta cidade e você estão tão tranquilos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И этот город и ты так безмятежны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa città e tu siete così silenziose</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhe cheng shi he ni dou hen an jing</span></p><p begin="1:52.670" end="1:57.510" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.670" end="1:52.880">慢</span><span begin="1:52.880" end="1:53.050">慢</span><span begin="1:53.050" end="1:53.490">穿</span><span begin="1:53.490" end="1:53.850">过</span><span begin="1:53.970" end="1:54.190">缤</span><span begin="1:54.280" end="1:54.740">纷</span><span begin="1:54.740" end="1:54.960">的</span><span begin="1:55.100" end="1:56.780">街</span><span begin="1:56.960" end="1:57.510">景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">慢慢穿過繽紛的街景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Slowly passing through the colorful street scenes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">色彩豊かな街並みをゆっくりと通り抜ける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알록달록한 거리 풍경을 천천히 지나가면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Traversant lentement les rues aux couleurs éclatantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Atravesando lentamente el colorido paisaje de las calles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Langsam durchqueren wir die bunten Straßen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Atravessando lentamente a paisagem colorida das ruas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Медленно проходя сквозь пестрые уличные пейзажи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraversando lentamente le scene colorate delle strade</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">man man chuan guo bin fen de jie jing</span></p><p begin="1:58.030" end="2:02.570" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.030" end="1:58.270">小</span><span begin="1:58.270" end="1:58.490">小</span><span begin="1:58.490" end="1:58.700">的</span><span begin="1:58.860" end="1:59.040">幸</span><span begin="1:59.150" end="1:59.630">福</span><span begin="2:00.170" end="2:00.590">也</span><span begin="2:00.590" end="2:00.840">一</span><span begin="2:00.840" end="2:01.040">路</span><span begin="2:01.190" end="2:01.620">随</span><span begin="2:01.780" end="2:02.570">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">小小的幸福也一路隨行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Little happiness also follows along the way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ささやかな幸せもずっと付いてくる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자그마한 행복도 이 길을 따라오네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un petit bonheur nous accompagne tout au long du chemin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una pequeña felicidad también nos acompaña en el camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein kleines bisschen Glück begleitet uns auf Schritt und Tritt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma pequena felicidade me acompanha, encantada com o caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И маленькое счастье следует за нами всю дорогу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Accompagnate da una piccola felicità lungo il cammino</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xiao xiao de xing fu ye yi lu sui xing</span></p><p begin="2:05.380" end="2:08.110" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.380" end="2:05.470">看</span><span begin="2:05.560" end="2:05.670">天</span><span begin="2:05.780" end="2:05.870">台</span><span begin="2:05.960" end="2:06.420">上</span><span begin="2:06.420" end="2:06.510">路</span><span begin="2:06.620" end="2:06.920">过</span><span begin="2:07.020" end="2:07.110">几</span><span begin="2:07.220" end="2:07.410">颗</span><span begin="2:07.410" end="2:07.510">流</span><span begin="2:07.630" end="2:08.110">星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">看天台上路過幾顆流星</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Watching a few shooting stars pass by over the rooftop</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">屋上を通り過ぎる幾つかの流れ星を見て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">옥상 위를 스쳐 지나가는 별똥별들을 봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Regarde ces étoiles filantes passer au-dessus du toit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Viendo pasar unas estrellas fugaces desde la azotea</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sieh wie ein paar Sternschnuppen über die Dachterrasse ziehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Olho para as estrelas cadentes passando pelo terraço</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Смотрю с крыши на пролетающие падающие звезды</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guarda qualche stella cadente passare sopra la terrazza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan tian tai shang lu guo ji ke liu xing</span></p><p begin="2:08.700" end="2:11.560" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.700" end="2:08.770">说</span><span begin="2:08.870" end="2:09.020">出</span><span begin="2:09.110" end="2:09.340">口</span><span begin="2:09.340" end="2:09.560">的</span><span begin="2:09.690" end="2:09.980">誓</span><span begin="2:09.980" end="2:10.400">言</span><span begin="2:10.400" end="2:10.580">会</span><span begin="2:10.580" end="2:10.700">有</span><span begin="2:10.820" end="2:11.020">回</span><span begin="2:11.020" end="2:11.560">音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">說出口的誓言會有回音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The vows spoken out loud will have an echo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">口にした誓いは必ず響き合う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">입 밖으로 꺼낸 맹세는 메아리가 되어 돌아올 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les vœux prononcés trouveront toujours un écho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las promesas pronunciadas tendrán su eco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ausgesprochene Schwüre werden ein Echo finden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As promessas ditas em voz alta terão um eco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Произнесенные клятвы обязательно отзовутся эхом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le promesse pronunciate avranno un&apos;eco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shuo chu kou de shi yan hui you hui yin</span></p><p begin="2:12.030" end="2:14.710" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.030" end="2:12.110">那</span><span begin="2:12.220" end="2:12.480">就</span><span begin="2:12.480" end="2:12.760">让</span><span begin="2:12.760" end="2:12.940">我</span><span begin="2:12.940" end="2:13.170">们</span><span begin="2:13.520" end="2:13.740">勇</span><span begin="2:13.740" end="2:13.850">敢</span><span begin="2:13.950" end="2:14.170">地</span><span begin="2:14.170" end="2:14.560">约</span><span begin="2:14.560" end="2:14.710">定</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那就讓我們勇敢地約定</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then let us bravely make a promise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だから勇敢に約束を交わそう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그럼 우리 용기 내어 약속하자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors faisons courageusement notre promesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entonces hagamos valientemente una promesa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Also lass uns mutig unser Versprechen geben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então vamos fazer a nossa promessa corajosamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так давай же смело дадим друг другу обещание</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Allora promettiamocelo coraggiosamente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na jiu rang wo men yong gan de yue ding</span></p><p begin="2:14.740" end="2:17.630" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.740" end="2:14.930">对</span><span begin="2:14.930" end="2:15.140">星</span><span begin="2:15.140" end="2:15.390">空</span><span begin="2:15.390" end="2:15.570">指</span><span begin="2:15.570" end="2:15.800">尖</span><span begin="2:15.800" end="2:15.880">画</span><span begin="2:15.990" end="2:16.440">出</span><span begin="2:16.440" end="2:16.520">了</span><span begin="2:16.650" end="2:16.900">心</span><span begin="2:17.070" end="2:17.630">形</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">對星空指尖畫出了心形</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Drawing a heart shape at the starry sky with our fingertips</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星空に向かって指先でハートを描く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별 쏟아지는 하늘에 손끝으로 하트를 그리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dessinant un cœur du bout des doigts vers le ciel étoilé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dibujando un corazón con la punta de los dedos hacia el firmamento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und mit den Fingerspitzen ein Herz in den Sternenhimmel zeichnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desenhando um coração com a ponta dos dedos para o céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Рисуя пальцами сердце на фоне звездного неба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Disegnando un cuore con le dita verso il cielo stellato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dui xing kong zhi jian hua chu le xin xing</span></p><p begin="2:18.040" end="2:21.230" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.040" end="2:18.240">星</span><span begin="2:18.240" end="2:18.360">际</span><span begin="2:18.470" end="2:18.680">闪</span><span begin="2:18.680" end="2:18.820">耀</span><span begin="2:18.920" end="2:19.350">光</span><span begin="2:19.350" end="2:19.770">影</span><span begin="2:19.770" end="2:19.960">落</span><span begin="2:19.960" end="2:20.160">入</span><span begin="2:20.160" end="2:20.360">你</span><span begin="2:20.360" end="2:20.550">的</span><span begin="2:20.550" end="2:20.970">眼</span><span begin="2:20.970" end="2:21.230">睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星際閃耀光影落入你的眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Interstellar shining light and shadows fall into your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星々の瞬く光と影が君の瞳に舞い落ちる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별무리의 반짝이는 빛이 네 눈동자에 내려앉아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;éclat scintillant des astres tombe dans tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La luz y sombra estelar brillan y caen en tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sternenlicht und Schatten fallen strahlend in deine Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O brilho cintilante do espaço cai nos seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мерцающий свет звезд падает в твои глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Luci e ombre brillanti delle stelle cadono nei tuoi occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xing ji shan yao guang ying luo ru ni de yan jing</span></p><p begin="2:21.620" end="2:24.650" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.620" end="2:21.850">如</span><span begin="2:21.850" end="2:22.040">迷</span><span begin="2:22.040" end="2:22.240">人</span><span begin="2:22.240" end="2:22.400">的</span><span begin="2:22.400" end="2:22.630">水</span><span begin="2:22.630" end="2:23.090">晶</span><span begin="2:23.090" end="2:23.190">把</span><span begin="2:23.330" end="2:23.600">浪</span><span begin="2:23.690" end="2:23.790">漫</span><span begin="2:23.880" end="2:24.280">放</span><span begin="2:24.280" end="2:24.650">映</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如迷人的水晶把浪漫放映</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like charming crystals projecting romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">魅惑的な水晶のようにロマンチックを映し出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">매혹적인 수정처럼 로맨스를 비춰주네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme un cristal envoûtant projetant la romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un cristal encantador proyectando el romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und projizieren Romantik wie ein bezaubernder Kristall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Projetando o romance como um cristal encantador</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно чарующий кристалл транслирующий романтику</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come un cristallo incantevole che proietta il romanticismo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ru mi ren de shui jing ba lang man fang ying</span></p><p begin="2:25.120" end="2:28.080" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.120" end="2:25.350">爱</span><span begin="2:25.350" end="2:25.570">是</span><span begin="2:25.570" end="2:25.790">种</span><span begin="2:25.790" end="2:25.860">魔</span><span begin="2:25.980" end="2:26.330">法</span><span begin="2:26.410" end="2:26.740">给</span><span begin="2:26.870" end="2:27.230">我</span><span begin="2:27.230" end="2:27.330">们</span><span begin="2:27.480" end="2:27.770">指</span><span begin="2:27.890" end="2:28.080">引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">愛是種魔法給我們指引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Love is a kind of magic guiding us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">愛は魔法のように私たちを導いてくれる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑은 우리를 이끌어주는 마법이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;amour est une magie qui nous guide</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El amor es una magia que nos guía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liebe ist eine Magie die uns leitet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O amor é uma magia que nos serve de guia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любовь это магия что указывает нам путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;amore è una magia che ci fa da guida</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ai shi zhong mo fa gei wo men zhi yin</span></p><p begin="2:28.460" end="2:31.440" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.460" end="2:28.720">穿</span><span begin="2:28.720" end="2:28.900">过</span><span begin="2:28.900" end="2:29.070">黑</span><span begin="2:29.070" end="2:29.170">暗</span><span begin="2:29.270" end="2:29.540">森</span><span begin="2:29.540" end="2:29.690">林</span><span begin="2:29.950" end="2:30.350">去</span><span begin="2:30.350" end="2:30.550">寻</span><span begin="2:30.550" end="2:30.760">找</span><span begin="2:30.760" end="2:30.860">黎</span><span begin="2:31.000" end="2:31.440">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過黑暗森林去尋找黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Through the dark forest to seek the dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">暗い森を抜けて夜明けを探しに行こう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어두운 숲을 지나 여명을 찾아가게 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la sombre forêt à la recherche de l&apos;aube</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Atravesando el bosque oscuro para buscar el amanecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch den dunklen Wald um die Morgendämmerung zu finden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Atravessando a floresta escura em busca do amanhecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь темный лес на поиски рассвета</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraversando la foresta oscura per cercare l&apos;alba</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chuan guo hei an sen lin qu xun zhao li ming</span></p><p begin="2:31.370" end="2:34.580" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.370" end="2:31.610">星</span><span begin="2:31.610" end="2:31.770">际</span><span begin="2:31.770" end="2:32.030">洒</span><span begin="2:32.030" end="2:32.150">下</span><span begin="2:32.260" end="2:32.670">光</span><span begin="2:32.670" end="2:33.080">影</span><span begin="2:33.080" end="2:33.320">点</span><span begin="2:33.320" end="2:33.510">亮</span><span begin="2:33.510" end="2:33.700">你</span><span begin="2:33.700" end="2:33.890">的</span><span begin="2:33.890" end="2:34.310">眼</span><span begin="2:34.310" end="2:34.580">睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星際灑下光影點亮你的眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Interstellar sprinkled light and shadows light up your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星々の光と影が降り注ぎ君の瞳を照らし出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별무리가 흩뿌린 빛이 네 눈동자를 밝히고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lueur des astres se répand et illumine tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El espacio esparce luz y sombra iluminando tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sternenlicht und Schatten regnen herab und erhellen deine Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O universo derrama luz iluminando os seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Звездный свет проливается зажигая твои глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le stelle spargono luci e ombre illuminando i tuoi occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xing ji sa xia guang ying dian liang ni de yan jing</span></p><p begin="2:34.920" end="2:38.000" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.920" end="2:35.170">像</span><span begin="2:35.170" end="2:35.360">缤</span><span begin="2:35.360" end="2:35.580">纷</span><span begin="2:35.580" end="2:35.800">的</span><span begin="2:35.800" end="2:35.880">梦</span><span begin="2:35.990" end="2:36.430">境</span><span begin="2:36.430" end="2:36.560">我</span><span begin="2:36.660" end="2:37.050">不</span><span begin="2:37.050" end="2:37.150">愿</span><span begin="2:37.250" end="2:37.540">苏</span><span begin="2:37.670" end="2:38.000">醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">像繽紛的夢境我不願甦醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a colorful dreamland from which I don&apos;t want to wake up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">色彩豊かな夢のようで私は目覚めたくない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다채로운 꿈결 같아 난 깨어나고 싶지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme un rêve coloré dont je refuse d&apos;être éveillée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un sueño colorido del que no quiero despertar maravillada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie ein farbenfroher Traum aus dem ich nicht erwachen will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como em um sonho colorido do qual eu, apaixonada, não quero acordar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно в красочном сне от которого я не хотела бы просыпаться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come in un sogno colorato da cui non voglio essere svegliata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xiang bin fen de meng jing wo bu yuan su xing</span></p><p begin="2:38.500" end="2:41.380" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.500" end="2:38.590">余</span><span begin="2:38.680" end="2:38.910">生</span><span begin="2:38.910" end="2:39.010">的</span><span begin="2:39.110" end="2:39.350">光</span><span begin="2:39.350" end="2:39.610">阴</span><span begin="2:39.740" end="2:40.180">牵</span><span begin="2:40.180" end="2:40.540">你</span><span begin="2:40.540" end="2:40.790">手</span><span begin="2:40.790" end="2:41.090">前</span><span begin="2:41.210" end="2:41.380">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">餘生的光陰牽你手前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Holding your hand to move forward for the rest of my life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">残りの人生の時間は君と手を繋いで歩んでいく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남은 생의 시간 동안 네 손을 잡고 나아갈게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je marcherai en te tenant la main pour le reste de ma vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El tiempo del resto de mi vida avanzaré aferrada a tu mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Rest meines Lebens werde ich deine Hand haltend voranschreiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No tempo que me resta caminharei segurando a sua mão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Остаток жизни я пройду держа тебя за руку</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per il resto del tempo camminerò tenendoti per mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu sheng de guang yin qian ni shou qian xing</span></p><p begin="2:41.640" end="2:47.350" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.640" end="2:41.740">我</span><span begin="2:41.830" end="2:42.250">们</span><span begin="2:42.250" end="2:42.360">共</span><span begin="2:42.460" end="2:42.680">赴</span><span begin="2:42.680" end="2:42.760">一</span><span begin="2:42.860" end="2:43.150">场</span><span begin="2:43.520" end="2:43.970">光</span><span begin="2:43.970" end="2:44.110">年</span><span begin="2:44.260" end="2:44.640">的</span><span begin="2:45.210" end="2:45.800">旅</span><span begin="2:46.050" end="2:47.350">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們共赴一場光年的旅行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s go on a light-year journey together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちは共に光年の旅へと出かけるんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리 함께 광년의 여행을 떠나자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Partons ensemble pour un voyage d&apos;une année-lumière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Juntos emprendemos un viaje de años luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir begeben uns gemeinsam auf eine lichtjahrelange Reise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos embarcar juntos em uma viagem de anos-luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы вместе отправимся в путешествие длиною в световой год</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Siamo pronte a partire per un viaggio lungo anni luce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo men gong fu yi chang guang nian de lv xing</span></p><p begin="2:48.060" end="2:51.280" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.060" end="2:48.310">星</span><span begin="2:48.310" end="2:48.420">际</span><span begin="2:48.530" end="2:48.750">闪</span><span begin="2:48.750" end="2:48.850">耀</span><span begin="2:48.950" end="2:49.330">光</span><span begin="2:49.330" end="2:49.770">影</span><span begin="2:49.770" end="2:50.000">落</span><span begin="2:50.000" end="2:50.100">入</span><span begin="2:50.190" end="2:50.380">你</span><span begin="2:50.380" end="2:50.520">的</span><span begin="2:50.610" end="2:51.030">眼</span><span begin="2:51.030" end="2:51.280">睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星際閃耀光影落入你的眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Interstellar shining light and shadows fall into your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星々の瞬く光と影が君の瞳に舞い落ちる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별무리의 반짝이는 빛이 네 눈동자에 내려앉아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;éclat scintillant des astres tombe dans tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La luz y sombra estelar brillan y caen en tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sternenlicht und Schatten fallen strahlend in deine Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O brilho cintilante do espaço cai nos seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мерцающий свет звезд падает в твои глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Luci e ombre brillanti delle stelle cadono nei tuoi occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xing ji shan yao guang ying luo ru ni de yan jing</span></p><p begin="2:51.680" end="2:54.760" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.680" end="2:51.880">如</span><span begin="2:51.880" end="2:52.080">迷</span><span begin="2:52.080" end="2:52.180">人</span><span begin="2:52.290" end="2:52.450">的</span><span begin="2:52.450" end="2:52.590">水</span><span begin="2:52.700" end="2:53.110">晶</span><span begin="2:53.110" end="2:53.200">把</span><span begin="2:53.370" end="2:53.610">浪</span><span begin="2:53.740" end="2:53.800">漫</span><span begin="2:53.920" end="2:54.320">放</span><span begin="2:54.320" end="2:54.760">映</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如迷人的水晶把浪漫放映</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like charming crystals projecting romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">魅惑的な水晶のようにロマンチックを映し出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">매혹적인 수정처럼 로맨스를 비춰주네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme un cristal envoûtant projetant la romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un cristal encantador proyectando el romance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und projizieren Romantik wie ein bezaubernder Kristall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Projetando o romance como um cristal encantador</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно чарующий кристалл транслирующий романтику</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come un cristallo incantevole che proietta il romanticismo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ru mi ren de shui jing ba lang man fang ying</span></p><p begin="2:55.190" end="2:58.060" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.190" end="2:55.270">爱</span><span begin="2:55.380" end="2:55.560">是</span><span begin="2:55.560" end="2:55.790">种</span><span begin="2:55.790" end="2:55.880">魔</span><span begin="2:55.990" end="2:56.270">法</span><span begin="2:56.430" end="2:56.820">给</span><span begin="2:56.820" end="2:57.260">我</span><span begin="2:57.260" end="2:57.370">们</span><span begin="2:57.510" end="2:57.870">指</span><span begin="2:57.870" end="2:58.060">引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">愛是種魔法給我們指引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Love is a kind of magic guiding us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">愛は魔法のように私たちを導いてくれる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑은 우리를 이끌어주는 마법이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L&apos;amour est une magie qui nous guide</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El amor es una magia que nos guía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liebe ist eine Magie die uns leitet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O amor é uma magia que nos serve de guia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любовь это магия что указывает нам путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;amore è una magia che ci fa da guida</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ai shi zhong mo fa gei wo men zhi yin</span></p><p begin="2:58.440" end="3:01.420" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.440" end="2:58.690">穿</span><span begin="2:58.690" end="2:58.890">过</span><span begin="2:58.890" end="2:59.070">黑</span><span begin="2:59.070" end="2:59.170">暗</span><span begin="2:59.280" end="2:59.610">森</span><span begin="2:59.610" end="2:59.850">林</span><span begin="2:59.940" end="3:00.350">去</span><span begin="3:00.350" end="3:00.550">寻</span><span begin="3:00.550" end="3:00.790">找</span><span begin="3:00.790" end="3:00.890">黎</span><span begin="3:01.000" end="3:01.420">明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過黑暗森林去尋找黎明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Through the dark forest to seek the dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">暗い森を抜けて夜明けを探しに行こう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어두운 숲을 지나 여명을 찾아가게 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la sombre forêt à la recherche de l&apos;aube</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Atravesando el bosque oscuro para buscar el amanecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch den dunklen Wald um die Morgendämmerung zu finden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Atravessando a floresta escura em busca do amanhecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь темный лес на поиски рассвета</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraversando la foresta oscura per cercare l&apos;alba</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chuan guo hei an sen lin qu xun zhao li ming</span></p><p begin="3:01.370" end="3:04.580" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.370" end="3:01.610">星</span><span begin="3:01.610" end="3:01.790">际</span><span begin="3:01.790" end="3:02.030">洒</span><span begin="3:02.030" end="3:02.130">下</span><span begin="3:02.250" end="3:02.670">光</span><span begin="3:02.670" end="3:03.070">影</span><span begin="3:03.070" end="3:03.320">点</span><span begin="3:03.320" end="3:03.520">亮</span><span begin="3:03.520" end="3:03.700">你</span><span begin="3:03.700" end="3:03.890">的</span><span begin="3:03.890" end="3:04.310">眼</span><span begin="3:04.310" end="3:04.580">睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星際灑下光影點亮你的眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Interstellar sprinkled light and shadows light up your eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">星々の光と影が降り注ぎ君の瞳を照らし出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">별무리가 흩뿌린 빛이 네 눈동자를 밝히고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lueur des astres se répand et illumine tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El espacio esparce luz y sombra iluminando tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sternenlicht und Schatten regnen herab und erhellen deine Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O universo derrama luz iluminando os seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Звездный свет проливается зажигая твои глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le stelle spargono luci e ombre illuminando i tuoi occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xing ji sa xia guang ying dian liang ni de yan jing</span></p><p begin="3:04.930" end="3:08.010" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.930" end="3:05.160">像</span><span begin="3:05.160" end="3:05.370">缤</span><span begin="3:05.370" end="3:05.600">纷</span><span begin="3:05.600" end="3:05.780">的</span><span begin="3:05.780" end="3:05.990">梦</span><span begin="3:05.990" end="3:06.430">境</span><span begin="3:06.430" end="3:06.500">我</span><span begin="3:06.670" end="3:07.010">不</span><span begin="3:07.010" end="3:07.110">愿</span><span begin="3:07.230" end="3:07.520">苏</span><span begin="3:07.650" end="3:08.010">醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">像繽紛的夢境我不願甦醒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a colorful dreamland from which I don&apos;t want to wake up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">色彩豊かな夢のようで私は目覚めたくない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다채로운 꿈결 같아 난 깨어나고 싶지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme un rêve coloré dont je refuse d&apos;être éveillée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un sueño colorido del que no quiero despertar maravillada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie ein farbenfroher Traum aus dem ich nicht erwachen will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como em um sonho colorido do qual eu, apaixonada, não quero acordar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно в красочном сне от которого я не хотела бы просыпаться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come in un sogno colorato da cui non voglio essere svegliata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xiang bin fen de meng jing wo bu yuan su xing</span></p><p begin="3:08.470" end="3:11.360" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.470" end="3:08.680">余</span><span begin="3:08.680" end="3:08.920">生</span><span begin="3:08.920" end="3:09.090">的</span><span begin="3:09.090" end="3:09.340">光</span><span begin="3:09.340" end="3:09.600">阴</span><span begin="3:09.720" end="3:10.140">牵</span><span begin="3:10.140" end="3:10.530">你</span><span begin="3:10.530" end="3:10.660">手</span><span begin="3:10.790" end="3:11.040">前</span><span begin="3:11.180" end="3:11.360">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">餘生的光陰牽你手前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Holding your hand to move forward for the rest of my life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">残りの人生の時間は君と手を繋いで歩んでいく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남은 생의 시간 동안 네 손을 잡고 나아갈게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je marcherai en te tenant la main pour le reste de ma vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El tiempo del resto de mi vida avanzaré aferrada a tu mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Rest meines Lebens werde ich deine Hand haltend voranschreiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No tempo que me resta caminharei segurando a sua mão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Остаток жизни я пройду держа тебя за руку</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per il resto del tempo camminerò tenendoti per mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu sheng de guang yin qian ni shou qian xing</span></p><p begin="3:11.640" end="3:17.550" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.640" end="3:11.750">我</span><span begin="3:11.850" end="3:12.240">们</span><span begin="3:12.240" end="3:12.360">共</span><span begin="3:12.460" end="3:12.680">赴</span><span begin="3:12.680" end="3:12.760">一</span><span begin="3:12.860" end="3:13.160">场</span><span begin="3:13.500" end="3:13.950">光</span><span begin="3:13.950" end="3:14.090">年</span><span begin="3:14.240" end="3:14.640">的</span><span begin="3:15.240" end="3:15.800">旅</span><span begin="3:16.070" end="3:17.550">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們共赴一場光年的旅行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s go on a light-year journey together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちは共に光年の旅へと出かけるんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리 함께 광년의 여행을 떠나자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Partons ensemble pour un voyage d&apos;une année-lumière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Juntos emprendemos un viaje de años luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir begeben uns gemeinsam auf eine lichtjahrelange Reise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos embarcar juntos em uma viagem de anos-luz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы вместе отправимся в путешествие длиною в световой год</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Siamo pronte a partire per un viaggio lungo anni luce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo men gong fu yi chang guang nian de lv xing</span></p></div></body></tt>